# =============================================================================
# 大腿 IMU 姿态估计与去重力 / Thigh IMU attitude estimation and gravity removal
#
# 本文件按“公开仓库”用途编写：排除运行环境、实验录制、下载物与本地文档。
# Written for public-repository use: excludes environments, experiment
# recordings, downloaded assets and local-only documents.
#
# 原则 / Principles:
#   1. 原始实验数据不入库，但必须在本机保留，不因不提交而删除。
#      Raw experiment data is never committed, but must be kept locally.
#   2. 代码与可复现的文本报告入库；逐包输出与大型产物不入库。
#      Code and reproducible text reports are committed; per-packet output is not.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python 运行环境与缓存 / Python environments and caches
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 编辑器与 IDE / Editors and IDEs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 实验录制与原始数据 / Experiment recordings and raw data
#
# recordings/ 与 live_recordings/ 保存真实六轴录制（packets.jsonl / states.jsonl /
# session.json）。按项目规定不提交；复现需要使用者自备录制。
# Real six-axis recordings are kept local by project policy. Reproduction
# requires the reader to supply their own recordings.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
recordings/
live_recordings/
recordings*.zip
live_recordings*.zip
*.mcap
*.bag
*.db3
*.jsonl

# 例外：将来若放入体积很小、确定性的测试样例，可解除下面一行的注释。
# Exception: uncomment if small deterministic samples are later added.
# !data/samples/*.jsonl

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 本地下载物与工具安装包 / Local downloads and installer assets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
downloads/
foxglove/
*.msi

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 文档构建中间产物 / Document build intermediates
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.document_work/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 外部仓库的本地克隆 / Local clone of an external repository
#
# repository-review/ 是另一个（外部）代码仓库的本地克隆副本，不随本仓库发布。
# 若不排除，Git 会把它当作嵌入式仓库（gitlink），产生损坏的子模块引用。
# It is a clone of an external repository; without this rule Git records it as
# an embedded repository and creates a broken submodule reference.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
repository-review/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 与项目无关的本地文件 / Local files unrelated to this project
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
tg-chat-translator/
personal.ipynb

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 本地文档（保留在本机，不随本仓库发布）
# Local documents (kept on the author's machine, not published here)
#
# 项目章程、进度总结与文件夹指南含姓名、预算与本机路径，均不适合公开。
# The charter, progress summary and folder guide contain names, budget figures
# and host-specific paths, so they are not published here.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 内部开发与协作日志 / Internal development and collaboration logs
#
# 这三个文件是本机的开发日志与协作约定：含本机绝对路径、内网地址、组号与
# 成员姓名，且内容面向本地工作流，对公开读者没有价值。它们保留在本机。
# These three files are local working logs and collaboration rules. They contain
# host paths, LAN addresses, group identifiers and member names, and are written
# for a local workflow rather than for public readers. They stay local.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
AGENTS.md
PROGRESS.md
NEXT_STEPS.md
